+  generated token fall from 11.41 -> 4.71 and 20.08 -> 8.86 respectively; the 2,307 / 2,247 successful RAM promotions
+  per run read another blob each and are counted separately. Tail skip tests VRAM residency, so moving an expert to
+  RAM does not exempt it from being skipped. This option reduces remaining file reads for experts that still have
+  to be evaluated. One machine and one quantization; blocking adaptation and `--spec 2` were not retested on v0.1.42.
